# 仮身一覧の速さとメモリを、同じ実行の中で比べる (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py: 画用紙
# holding 120 closed links in four columns of 30 (xmlbig), opened with 仮身一覧 by the desktop's
# cabinet (open) and by 仮身一覧 running as a process (pcab) in turn, three times each, so that
# both are measured under the same load of the machine. Each time a link is taken and then the
# empty page between the columns pressed, five times. Compared: "desktop: cabinet input to
# screen US us" and "cabinet: input to screen US us" (from the press to the window drawn),
# the time to open (waitwin; hosttime from pcab to "cabinet: opened ... up in US us") and what the process has mapped
# as it closes ("cabinet: mapped KB KB").
cabproc kernel
mkbig fig 1 0
